# Ignore all output content (local only)
*

# But track these files and folders
!README.md
!.gitignore
!sessions/
!sessions/**
!archive/
!archive/**
!briefs/
!briefs/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**

# ...but never binaries. Prototype assets live in Cloudflare R2, not git —
# see docs/guides/prototype-hosting.md. Without these rules the `!sessions/**`
# line above overrides the root .gitignore's image rules, which is how 117MB of
# PNGs became stageable in August 2026.
sessions/**/*.png
sessions/**/*.jpg
sessions/**/*.jpeg
sessions/**/*.webp
sessions/**/*.gif
sessions/**/*.avif
sessions/**/*.svg
sessions/**/*.mp4
sessions/**/*.webm
sessions/**/*.mov
sessions/**/.impeccable/
sessions/**/.DS_Store

# Capture dumps. `research/screenshots/**/report.json` is machine-generated by
# research/tools/capture-site.mts and describes screenshots that are themselves
# ignored above — so committing it stores 1MB of measurements referencing images
# nobody else can see. The conclusions live in the teardown markdown; re-run the
# script to regenerate the raw data.
sessions/**/screenshots/
